{
    "name": "PL_J390_Movimiento_Compra_Monex",
    "type": "Microsoft.DataFactory/factories/pipelines",
    "properties": {
        "description": "Pipeline orquestador Job 1 J390_Movimiento_Compra_Monex. Flujo: (1) WebActivity BTEQ BeforeSubr Bteq_Event_Bloquea.sh, (2) ExecuteDataFlow DF_J390_Mov_Com_Monex_Valida. BeforeSubr DS: DSU.ExecSH {PathShell}/Bteq_Event_Bloquea.sh {Teradata_EDW_DSN}/{User},{PWD} {EDW_Event_Bel} {PathLog} J390_Mov_Cmp Fase_4",
        "activities": [
            {
                "name": "Execute_BTEQ_Event_Bloquea",
                "description": "MANUAL_INTERVENTION: Equivale al BeforeSubr DS: DSU.ExecSH #$PathShell#Bteq_Event_Bloquea.sh #$Teradata_EDW_DSN#/#$Teradata_EDW_User_Grupo1#,#$Teradata_EDW_PWD_Grupo1# #$EDW_Event_Bel# #$PathLog# 'J390_Mov_Cmp' 'Fase_4'. El script BTEQ bloquea la tabla de eventos en Teradata antes de iniciar el procesamiento. Requiere Azure Function o Self-hosted IR con Teradata Client instalado. Completar la URL y Key del Azure Function.",
                "type": "WebActivity",
                "dependsOn": [],
                "policy": {
                    "timeout": "0.01:00:00",
                    "retry": 0,
                    "retryIntervalInSeconds": 30,
                    "secureOutput": true,
                    "secureInput": true
                },
                "userProperties": [],
                "typeProperties": {
                    "url": {
                        "value": "@pipeline().parameters.AzureFunction_Bteq_Url",
                        "type": "Expression"
                    },
                    "method": "POST",
                    "headers": {
                        "Content-Type": "application/json",
                        "x-functions-key": {
                            "value": "@pipeline().parameters.AzureFunction_Bteq_Key",
                            "type": "Expression"
                        }
                    },
                    "body": {
                        "value": "@json(concat('{\"script\":\"Bteq_Event_Bloquea.sh\",\"Teradata_EDW_DSN\":\"', pipeline().parameters.Teradata_EDW_DSN, '\",\"EDW_Event_Bel\":\"', pipeline().parameters.EDW_Event_Bel, '\",\"PathLog\":\"', pipeline().parameters.PathLog, '\",\"JobName\":\"J390_Mov_Cmp\",\"Fase\":\"Fase_4\"}'))",
                        "type": "Expression"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "name": "Execute_DF_J390_Valida",
                "description": "Ejecuta Data Flow de validacion y reglas de negocio J390. Mapea los stages Trf_Traductor + Trf_Valida con 7 lookups Teradata y 5 outputs. MANUAL_INTERVENTION: fncSev390MovComMonex debe reimplementarse en DeriveReglasSeveridad del data flow.",
                "type": "ExecuteDataFlow",
                "dependsOn": [
                    {
                        "activity": "Execute_BTEQ_Event_Bloquea",
                        "dependencyConditions": ["Succeeded"]
                    }
                ],
                "policy": {
